        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_Demo_01:Demo_01_023:c541dd1c",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_Demo_01:Demo_01_023:c541dd1c",
        "jp_sha256": "db043a67064ef48d56138cacdd11572074c7835d4f0d0dfa3322df2e8ac8298e",
        "official_en_sha256": "283c3261f3e9ba8b523c2afb9299094c674d35cd998333cc0d238c8bd9e9e9ff"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、そうだな、常闇。\r\n世界が滅ぼうと知ったことではない。\r\nそれでこそ、お前だ。",
        "official_en": "Well said, Umbra. It need not matter if the world is brought to ruin. Vengeance is your calling.",
        "real_en": "Yes, Veritas of the Dark.\nYou wouldn't care even if the world were destroyed.\nThat's just like you."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
