        "official_en_sha256": "44da7d9a4edea26d55f80fc1363e494ec652b39eb1b339a06cb8801c0b269a52"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、あそこまでの道は魔物が多いし……。\r\nって、ダメダメ、弱気になったら。",
        "official_en": "On second thought, though, the trail is full of feisty monsters... Ugh, what am I saying? I need to grow a spine.",
        "real_en": "But the road there is full of monsters...\nNo, no! I can't lose my nerve now."
      },
