      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何かよくないことが起こりそうな……。\r\n嫌な予感がします……。",
        "official_en": "This doesn’t bode well... Something undesirable may be on the horizon...",
        "real_en": "I have a bad feeling...\nLike something awful is about to happen..."
